>
  <p data-en="These Terms of Service (“Terms”) govern your access to and use of the BiasharaPOS application, website and related services (the “Service”). By creating an account or using the Service, you agree to be bound by these Terms." data-sw="Masharti haya ya Huduma (“Masharti”) yanasimamia ufikiaji na matumizi yako ya programu ya BiasharaPOS, tovuti na huduma zinazohusiana (“Huduma”). Kwa kufungua akaunti au kutumia Huduma, unakubali kufungwa na Masharti haya.">These Terms of Service (“Terms”) govern your access to and use of the BiasharaPOS application, website and related services (the “Service”). By creating an account or using the Service, you agree to be bound by these Terms.</p>

  <h2 data-en="Eligibility &amp; accounts" data-sw="Ustahiki na akaunti">Eligibility &amp; accounts</h2>
