  <h2 data-en="Your online shop and deliveries" data-sw="Duka lako la mtandaoni na usafirishaji">Your online shop and deliveries</h2>
  <p data-en="If you open an online shop, you are the seller. You are responsible for what you list and the prices you set, for having the stock you offer, for fulfilling or cancelling orders, and for anything your own riders do while delivering for you. We pass orders and messages between you and your customers; we are not a party to the sale." data-sw="Ukifungua duka la mtandaoni, wewe ndiye muuzaji. Una jukumu la unachoorodhesha na bei unazoweka, kuwa na stoki unayotangaza, kutimiza au kughairi oda, na kwa chochote madereva wako wanachofanya wakisafirisha kwa niaba yako. Sisi tunapitisha oda na ujumbe kati yako na wateja wako; sisi si upande wa mauzo.">If you open an online shop, you are the seller. You are responsible for what you list and the prices you set, for having the stock you offer, for fulfilling or cancelling orders, and for anything your own riders do while delivering for you. We pass orders and messages between you and your customers; we are not a party to the sale.</p>
  <p data-en="Your customers’ details belong to them and to you, not to us — we hold them on your behalf. You are responsible for handling them lawfully, including under applicable data protection laws, and for answering your customers if they ask what you hold about them. Order messages are sent in your shop’s name, so keep them to what the order requires; the Service is not for marketing campaigns." data-sw="Taarifa za wateja wako ni zao na zako, si zetu — sisi tunazihifadhi kwa niaba yako. Una jukumu la kuzishughulikia kisheria, ikiwa ni pamoja na sheria husika za ulinzi wa data, na kuwajibu wateja wako wanapouliza unachohifadhi kuwahusu. Ujumbe wa oda hutumwa kwa jina la duka lako, hivyo uweke kwenye yale tu oda inayohitaji; Huduma si kwa kampeni za matangazo.">Your customers’ details belong to them and to you, not to us — we hold them on your behalf. You are responsible for handling them lawfully, including under applicable data protection laws, and for answering your customers if they ask what you hold about them. Order messages are sent in your shop’s name, so keep them to what the order requires; the Service is not for marketing campaigns.</p>

